e of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in November to December and 65% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 41% on the middle of the grids. Grid 22368 had its driest year in 1953 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
